  "notes": "Extracted from the primary paper (snippet: M9 minimal salts medium (8.5 g.l−1 Na2HPO4, 3 g.l−1 of KH2PO4, 1 g.l−1 of ammonium chloride, 0.5 g.l−1 of NaCl) supplemented with 0.5% glucose, 0.005% l-tryptophane, 0.1 mM CaCl2, 1 mM of MgSO4 and tr). Component names mapped to BiGG (see mapping_confidence); presence-based bounds unless the paper gave exchange bounds; concentration_mM where units allowed. Extraction confidence: high.",
